This directory contains the source for the KUtrace loadable module for NVIDIA
Grace (Neoverse V2, arm64), and its Makefile. The make uses the kernel exported
symbols on the compilation machine. These need to include the exported KUtrace
symbols from applying the kernel patch in ../linux-nvidia-7.0 or
../linux-nvidia-6.17.

All the code is open sourced under the BSD three-clause license, except the 
loadable module which is required by Linux to be licensed under GPL.
